sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Guest checkout with a Virtual Card Token and a DTVC
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: Guest checkout with a Virtual Card Token and a DTVC. 6 participants: Consumer, Agent platform, Mastercard network, Merchant, Acquirer or PSP, and Issuer. 7 steps, 7 crossing a trust boundary, 1 failure branch. Based on mastercard-agent-pay Agent Pay developer guides (unversioned, read 2026-10-11) (2026-10-11). Step 1: Consumer to Agent platform: User validation and consent. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: Agent platform to Mastercard network: Request checkout for merchant domain. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 3: Mastercard network to Agent platform: Return token, expiry and DTVC. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 4: Agent platform to Merchant: Type values into card form. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 5: Merchant to Acquirer or PSP: Submit authorization. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 6: Acquirer or PSP to Mastercard network: Authorization with token. This step crosses a trust boundary. If DTVC wrong or already used: Validation fails and the issuer is told (outcome and response code not published). Step 7: Mastercard network to Issuer: Tell issuer DTVC result. This step crosses a trust boundary.
  autonumber
  participant p_consumer as Consumer
  participant p_agent as Agent platform
  participant p_network as Mastercard network
  participant p_merchant as Merchant
  participant p_acquirer as Acquirer or PSP
  participant p_issuer as Issuer
  p_consumer->>p_agent: User validation and consent
  Note over p_consumer,p_agent: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_agent->>p_network: Request checkout for merchant domain
  Note over p_agent,p_network: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_network-->>p_agent: Return token, expiry and DTVC
  Note over p_network,p_agent: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_agent->>p_merchant: Type values into card form
  Note over p_agent,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_merchant->>p_acquirer: Submit authorization
  Note over p_merchant,p_acquirer: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_acquirer->>p_network: Authorization with token
    Note over p_acquirer,p_network: Crosses a trust boundary
  else DTVC wrong or already used
    Note over p_acquirer,p_network: Validation fails and the issuer is told<br/>(outcome and response code not published)
  end
  p_network->>p_issuer: Tell issuer DTVC result
  Note over p_network,p_issuer: Crosses a trust boundary
